                          <p className="block my-[0.85rem]" data-ditto-id="style-div-65">
                            NPD may utilize Artificial Intelligence (AI) technologies, including, but not limited to, generative AI solutions, to enhance your experience on our website and improve our services. By using NPD’s website and services, you acknowledge and agree that if you choose to provide information to an AI technology platform, you do so at your own discretion and risk. You are solely responsible for the information you provide, and NPD will not be liable for any consequences arising from such disclosures. Furthermore, NPD cannot be held responsible for any decisions made based on outputs generated by AI technologies. We encourage you to be mindful when sharing information with these systems.
                          </p>
                          {" "}
                          <p className="block my-[0.85rem]" data-ditto-id="style-heading-27">
                            If you choose to use AI-powered services offered through our platforms (such as Content Studio), we may collect and process information you provide in order to generate requested outputs and operate those services. This may include:
                          </p>
                          {" "}
                          <ul className="block mb-5 ml-[0.4375rem] [list-style-type:disc] list-outside">
                            {ListRow2_data17.map((d, i) => <ListRow2 key={i} d={d} />)}
                          </ul>
                          {" "}
                          <p className="block my-[0.85rem]" data-ditto-id="style-text-7">
                            We use this information to provide AI-powered features, generate requested outputs, enable automated publishing functionality, improve service performance, and maintain platform security.
                          </p>
                          {" "}
                          <p className="block my-[0.85rem]" data-ditto-id="style-text-9">
                            We do not use user-submitted content to train our proprietary machine learning models. Certain information submitted through AI-powered services may be processed by third-party AI service providers for the purpose of generating requested outputs. We configure our integrations with third-party AI providers to utilize their “non-training” API pathways where available. While we endeavor to ensure that user-submitted content is not used for model training by these providers, users acknowledge that such processing is subject to the third-party providers’ respective terms of service and privacy policies.
                          </p>
                          {" "}
                          <p className="block my-[0.85rem]">
                            To operate these services, we may share limited information with third-party providers including AI model providers, SEO data providers, plagiarism detection services, cloud hosting providers, and publishing platform APIs. These providers process information solely to provide services on our behalf. By connecting a third-party publishing platform, you acknowledge that your information will also be subject to the privacy policies of those respective platforms.
                          </p>
                          {" "}
